#. Description of the plugin
#: arkid-catalogue-link.php
msgid "Link products in your WooCommerce store with the ARkid catalogue. Embed 3D / AR viewers on the product display page."
msgstr "将您的 WooCommerce 商店中的产品与 ARkid 目录关联。在产品展示页面嵌入 3D/AR 查看器。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: arkid-catalogue-link.php
msgid "ARkid"
msgstr "ARkid"

#. translators: 1: required PHP version, 2: current PHP version
#: arkid-catalogue-link.php:55
msgid "ARkid Catalogue Link requires PHP %1$s or later. You are running PHP %2$s."
msgstr "ARkid Catalogue Link 需要 PHP %1$s 或更高版本。您正在使用 PHP %2$s。"

#: arkid-catalogue-link.php:103
msgid "ARkid Catalogue Link is missing its Composer autoloader. Run `composer install` inside the plugin directory."
msgstr "ARkid Catalogue Link 缺少 Composer 自动加载器。请在插件目录中运行 `composer install`。"

